  "inline_comments": [
    {
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Validate before dispatching to local tools**\n\nWhen `VLLM_USE_EXPERIMENTAL_PARSER_CONTEXT=1` is combined with `--tool-server demo`, the session is a `Tool`, so the early return above bypasses this validation; `HarmonyPythonTool.get_result_parsable_context()` then still evaluates `args[\"code\"]` and raises the original `KeyError`, leaving this configuration with the HTTP 500 the change intends to fix. Move the validation before the `isinstance(tool_session, Tool)` branch (and cover that branch rather than only using a `MagicMock` session).\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L89-L91](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/7a9ea2b6e153edaf9233b760a2375b0067e347b5/AGENTS.md#L89-L91)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
